SPOILER:
For reference, here are the main non-invocation uses of the bell,
candelabrum, and book:

bell: acts like a combined wand of SDD and wand of opening (when
engulfed by monsters). It's really useful to detect the door of the
Sanctum as well as plane portals, but only has 3 charges.

candelabrum: as others have said, game's best light source but short-
lived.

book: tames liches and demiliches, makes master/arch liches peaceful,
makes other undead flee - *if* you're chaotic and the book is
blessed... could be useful for genoless/pacifist players!



